  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free Education Project, Sierra Leone Multi-Donor  Imprest Request No. 19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;FREE Education&#x2019; Project is a 5 year project in support of the education sector in Sierra Leone which commenced in September 2019. The project is a partnership between the World Bank, EU, DFID &amp; Irish AID and Ministry of Basic and Senior Secondary Education (MoBSSE).  The project with an overall budget of $66M is financed through a World Bank IDA grant of $50M and $16M from a Multi Donor Trust Fund with contributions from Ireland, UK and EU.The Mission plans on contributing at least &#x20ac;5million euro and potentially up to &#x20ac;7million euro to  the MDTF over a period of 5 years 2019-2024 with the initial contribution of &#x20ac;1million Euro being made in early 2020 from 2020 IDC.</narrative>
  </description>
